Package: orbit-os-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Orbit OS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: orbit-os-branding (= @VERSION@), orbit-launcher (= @VERSION@), gnome-shell (>= 46), gnome-shell (<< 47),
 gnome-shell-extension-ubuntu-dock, gnome-shell-extensions,
 librsvg2-bin, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, fprintd, libpam-fprintd, power-profiles-daemon, fwupd,
 bluez, thermald, intel-media-va-driver, ufw, unattended-upgrades, dconf-cli
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-blur-my-shell, @RECOMMENDS@
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Orbit OS desktop (based on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS)
 Installs and configures the Orbit OS desktop on Ubuntu 24.04: theme and
 dconf defaults, Orbit Launcher, Orbit Settings, first-run welcome, the
 ~/Home folder layout for new users, firewall on, fingerprint PAM,
 automatic security updates. Install it on an existing Ubuntu 24.04
 system to convert it.
